I've recently received reports of unauthorized use of Project Feline’s gameplay footage and branding to promote scam games and seize user information. They lure victims with unsolicited texts, emails or direct messages asking you to beta test a game that looks identical to Project Feline and linking to an unsecured site, an unlisted YouTube trailer, a fake Itch page, or a Dropbox download. Do not click these links. These are not from me; these are Turkish scammers. I'm in the process of filing an appeal to shut these sites down.

When I have a demo ready, I will not be direct-messaging people individually to link you an unlisted trailer or a Dropbox download. I will send the word out via the email list or in a post via official channels.

